From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chromium-blink-ios <noreply@github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] iOS Curium: quiet Google services and start opt-in loopback DevTools

Disable component update checks, AIM eligibility requests, unbranded JS
error uploads and background Translate resources. Default iOS profiles to
no Safe Browsing protection and bypass consumer checks for opted-out
profiles. Keep managed URL filtering and explicit Translate script fetches.

Start Content's DevTools HTTP server only for a valid remote debugging port
switch. Listen on IPv4 loopback and stop the server during browser shutdown.

